WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:00.980
LEVIATAN Episode 1 "I'll
Make You My Friend!"

00:05.850 --> 00:08.360
The planet of water, Aquafall.

00:08.980 --> 00:12.650
In the small and peaceful town of Haruna,

00:12.650 --> 00:15.490
there lives a cute girl named Leviatan...

00:15.490 --> 00:17.570
...and approximately two other characters.

00:17.570 --> 00:19.580
This is their heart-warming story.

00:22.580 --> 00:24.420
First there were stars.

00:25.080 --> 00:28.040
Then the gods made people
in their own image,

00:28.040 --> 00:32.010
and gave them the wisdom of the gods.

00:32.630 --> 00:36.390
The people with the
knowledge of one apple...

00:36.390 --> 00:39.050
...were blessed and were
led to more apples.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.310
Those unable to comprehend the
knowledge of the one apple were judged,

00:43.890 --> 00:49.020
and eventually returned to nothingness
under the name of the demiurge.

02:51.230 --> 02:53.730
I'll Make You My Friend!

02:57.610 --> 03:00.320
Oh, good morning, Leviatan.

03:00.320 --> 03:01.910
The weather is nice again
this morning, isn't it?

03:02.490 --> 03:04.070
Good morning.

03:04.280 --> 03:06.740
Would you like to eat
breakfast together?

03:07.490 --> 03:10.790
Thank you, but I have morning training.

03:11.080 --> 03:12.880
I see. I'll see you later, then.

03:16.090 --> 03:20.720
Flare of the sun,
show yourself and obey me.

03:21.760 --> 03:23.430
Smash this rock.

03:25.970 --> 03:26.970
What?

03:28.310 --> 03:32.690
Corona of the sun, show yourself and...

03:34.810 --> 03:36.150
Ouch...

03:36.730 --> 03:38.150
What's his problem?

03:38.150 --> 03:39.150
How obnoxious.

03:44.660 --> 03:46.580
Wait!

03:56.130 --> 03:58.380
Ouch...

03:58.840 --> 04:00.510
What's that?

04:01.340 --> 04:03.340
I've never seen a bug like this before.

04:04.180 --> 04:05.590
All right.

04:06.640 --> 04:08.350
Hold still!

04:09.100 --> 04:10.060
I missed.

04:24.780 --> 04:25.910
What was that?

04:34.750 --> 04:35.790
There it is!

04:39.670 --> 04:40.250
Fire!

04:42.670 --> 04:43.800
There!

04:48.890 --> 04:50.100
It disappeared.

04:51.140 --> 04:53.980
Huh? Was it defeated?

04:53.980 --> 04:54.890
Yeah.

04:54.890 --> 04:56.650
Oh, hello.

04:56.650 --> 04:58.060
Hey.

04:58.650 --> 05:00.070
Um...

05:00.480 --> 05:03.320
I-I've got a delivery to make.

05:03.320 --> 05:04.610
Later.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.860
I've got to get going, too.

05:09.160 --> 05:10.240
Who were they?

05:39.610 --> 05:40.980
Onii-chan...

05:53.490 --> 05:54.410
Good.

05:54.750 --> 05:56.370
That's it, Levi.

05:56.370 --> 05:59.170
You'll become an incredible water user.

06:38.040 --> 06:39.160
Onii-chan.

06:40.210 --> 06:41.170
Watch this!

06:45.710 --> 06:46.920
That scream...

06:49.590 --> 06:50.880
What was that?

07:01.190 --> 07:03.690
Poke, poke, poke.

07:06.570 --> 07:07.740
I found you!

07:07.740 --> 07:09.030
Huh? Found what?

07:09.400 --> 07:10.900
Oh, good.

07:10.900 --> 07:14.030
You can't imagine how much I've
been flying around Aquafall.

07:14.580 --> 07:19.040
I was about to give up
on finding members...

07:19.620 --> 07:21.370
But I finally found you.

07:21.370 --> 07:22.880
We were destined to meet.

07:23.880 --> 07:26.920
What members? What destiny?

07:26.920 --> 07:27.800
What?

07:27.800 --> 07:29.720
Why would you say that?
Aren't we friends?

07:30.010 --> 07:34.050
No, we're not friends.
I don't even know who you are.

07:34.930 --> 07:36.430
Y-You're right.

07:37.180 --> 07:38.560
I'm Syrop.

07:38.560 --> 07:40.270
As you can see, I'm a fairy.

07:41.020 --> 07:43.900
Of course, I'm sure you
already know, but...

07:43.900 --> 07:46.230
A meteorite fell on Aquafall.

07:46.820 --> 07:50.490
The invaders who poured out from
it are causing lots of trouble.

07:50.490 --> 07:54.410
At this rate, all the creatures of
this planet will become extinct.

07:55.370 --> 07:57.870
But it'd be weird for us
to wait around for death.

07:57.870 --> 08:01.120
It's our lives and our planet.

08:01.710 --> 08:03.790
Now is the time to make a stand!

08:04.330 --> 08:05.960
So, anyway...

08:05.960 --> 08:10.510
I'm looking for members to
form the Aquafall Defense.

08:11.720 --> 08:12.630
Huh?

08:14.470 --> 08:16.800
H-Hey, wait!

08:17.430 --> 08:21.430
That amazing column of water
was your magic, right?

08:21.430 --> 08:24.100
You shot me while I was
flying over the forest!

08:24.400 --> 08:26.150
It's an amazing ability!

08:27.360 --> 08:30.280
I know about the fallen meteorite.

08:30.730 --> 08:33.860
I also know large numbers of strange
creatures are coming from it.

08:35.240 --> 08:36.490
Yeah, that's it.

08:36.820 --> 08:41.040
But I have never felt the
danger you are describing.

08:41.040 --> 08:43.830
The danger just hasn't arrived here yet.

08:43.830 --> 08:45.370
If we wait until we see signs
of it, it'll be too late.

08:45.710 --> 08:47.630
This town is peaceful.

08:47.630 --> 08:48.920
Everyone knows that.

08:49.590 --> 08:50.840
Besides, I...

08:54.680 --> 08:56.510
I'm not going anywhere.

09:00.310 --> 09:02.310
Please wait...

09:09.110 --> 09:10.820
What an impressive appetite.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.940
I've been looking for people to join me...

09:13.940 --> 09:17.780
...for three days and nights
and didn't eat or drink anything.

09:18.870 --> 09:21.580
Anyway, this bread is delicious.

09:21.580 --> 09:22.790
More, please!

09:23.580 --> 09:24.870
There's no more.

09:24.870 --> 09:25.830
I'm sorry.

09:25.830 --> 09:27.210
Was that not enough?

09:27.210 --> 09:29.920
Oh, no. I'm stuffed.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.800
Thank you for the food.

09:36.090 --> 09:38.640
Mushussu-san.

09:38.930 --> 09:40.470
That girl...

09:41.680 --> 09:44.180
Jörmungand-chan,
are you running errands?

09:44.560 --> 09:46.060
Where is Travis?

09:46.060 --> 09:50.020
He says I'm old enough to
start making coal deliveries.

09:50.020 --> 09:51.110
I see.

09:51.110 --> 09:53.860
In that case, maybe I'll
order two sacks next time.

09:53.860 --> 09:55.360
Sure, leave it to me.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.400
Really?

09:56.400 --> 09:58.410
Thank you. It's a big help.

09:58.780 --> 10:00.780
Say hi to Travis for me.

10:03.580 --> 10:05.950
Shall we get something to eat in town?

10:07.410 --> 10:08.420
Yes!

10:15.380 --> 10:16.880
Wow.

10:17.300 --> 10:20.890
It's a small town, but we
have all the usual shops.

10:21.260 --> 10:23.390
A weapon shop,
an item shop, an inn...

10:23.390 --> 10:24.970
We even have a marshal.

10:27.480 --> 10:29.810
What's that gathering of people?

10:33.610 --> 10:35.150
That's everyone.

10:35.150 --> 10:35.730
Yes.

10:36.820 --> 10:39.030
I may not need to tell you now,

10:39.030 --> 10:41.490
but I want to give everyone
accurate information.

10:42.120 --> 10:44.540
Rumors will only fan the
flames of insecurity.

10:44.990 --> 10:46.410
We understand.

10:47.200 --> 10:49.870
I wish I could go with you, but...

10:49.870 --> 10:54.920
No, no. Nothing would make the people
more insecure than if you left the town.

10:54.920 --> 10:56.260
It's all right.

10:56.260 --> 10:57.880
You can count on us.

10:58.380 --> 11:01.140
We may not look it,
but we're all reliable men.

11:01.970 --> 11:05.350
Your goal is to get a grasp of the situation.

11:05.890 --> 11:08.600
Make sure you don't get into any fights.

11:09.230 --> 11:10.980
We'll be waiting for your information.

11:10.980 --> 11:13.560
Yes, sir. We'll be on our way.

11:15.070 --> 11:19.900
If you're too persistent,
you'll only drive girls away.

11:20.110 --> 11:23.450
What's your problem? I was just saying hi.

11:25.370 --> 11:28.080
You should be able to tell
if someone really hates you...

11:28.080 --> 11:31.330
...by calmly observing their eyes.

11:31.920 --> 11:35.920
Well, if you could understand that,
girls could do anything they wanted.

11:37.500 --> 11:38.840
What?!

11:38.840 --> 11:41.680
I'd never talk to a little kid like you!

11:41.680 --> 11:43.050
A little kid...

11:43.590 --> 11:45.680
Don't you know who I am?

11:45.680 --> 11:46.890
I know who you are.

11:46.890 --> 11:49.770
You're the daughter
of the mage Rage Row.

11:50.310 --> 11:53.440
But that doesn't make
you important, does it?

11:53.900 --> 11:55.940
You don't seem to understand.

11:55.940 --> 11:59.360
Th-They tried to look at my scales!

11:59.360 --> 12:00.400
They're perverts!

12:02.110 --> 12:03.610
That's unforgivable!

12:03.610 --> 12:05.570
I'm an ally of girls!

12:12.710 --> 12:13.790
You want to fight?!

12:14.790 --> 12:16.880
What's going on?
What are they arguing about?

12:18.250 --> 12:21.340
This one's the good guy,
and that's the bad guy.

12:21.550 --> 12:23.050
I'm right!

12:23.590 --> 12:25.550
What did you call us?

12:25.550 --> 12:26.050
Huh?

12:26.680 --> 12:28.310
Wh-What?!

12:28.310 --> 12:30.850
Fairies are honest.

12:30.850 --> 12:32.810
She judged you instantly.

12:32.810 --> 12:36.060
Don't do anything bad again.

12:36.060 --> 12:37.520
I must be going.

12:37.520 --> 12:38.690
What?!

12:38.690 --> 12:39.900
Hey, wait! Hey!

12:39.900 --> 12:40.690
Excuse me...

12:40.690 --> 12:42.530
This is none of your business!
Stay out of it!

12:42.900 --> 12:44.700
I-I'm sorry!

12:44.700 --> 12:46.200
I'm sorry for speaking the truth!

12:46.820 --> 12:49.790
Champions of justice are beautiful.

12:49.790 --> 12:51.290
It's all about appearances!

12:51.290 --> 12:52.160
Besides...

12:58.920 --> 13:02.260
Even if you were reborn five or six times,
I don't think you'd get together.

13:07.640 --> 13:09.050
So close!

13:09.050 --> 13:10.760
Don't get ahead of yourself!

13:10.760 --> 13:11.930
I'll crush you!

13:13.850 --> 13:15.730
This is none of my business!

13:15.730 --> 13:16.350
You brat!

13:18.020 --> 13:18.940
Hey, you!

13:18.940 --> 13:20.860
Wait!

13:27.870 --> 13:29.740
This is the only place to eat in town.

13:29.740 --> 13:32.790
The Dragon's Key Tail.

13:33.950 --> 13:35.580
Let's go inside...

13:35.580 --> 13:36.580
What?

13:37.460 --> 13:39.250
Oh, well.

13:40.460 --> 13:41.960
Welcome!

13:42.630 --> 13:44.800
Leviatan, welcome.

13:45.470 --> 13:47.180
Hello, barkeep.

13:47.180 --> 13:50.470
Do you have any information
about my brother?

13:52.390 --> 13:55.520
Sorry, but there isn't
any new information.

13:56.020 --> 13:58.270
I've been asking all kinds of
people about him, though.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.690
Is barley tea okay?

14:01.690 --> 14:03.440
Yes, thank you...

14:03.940 --> 14:07.280
It's Lanet barley tea brewed in
water from a spring on Mount Leona.

14:09.030 --> 14:10.990
I wonder where he could be...

14:11.740 --> 14:14.330
I can't believe he's making
his little sister so sad.

14:14.870 --> 14:17.290
What a terrible brother.

14:17.790 --> 14:18.670
He's so selfish.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.710
Don't speak poorly of my brother!

14:22.340 --> 14:24.710
I-I'm so sorry!

14:24.960 --> 14:28.180
No, I should be the one apologizing.

14:34.260 --> 14:37.850
Your brother is fine. He's doing well.

14:37.850 --> 14:40.350
I'm sure he's always
thinking of you, too.

14:41.060 --> 14:42.560
I can vouch for that.

14:43.070 --> 14:44.400
Barkeep...

14:44.400 --> 14:45.900
You must be hungry.

14:45.900 --> 14:47.440
I'll make you some pasta.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.240
I love pasta!

14:49.240 --> 14:50.490
Give me a large serving!

14:50.490 --> 14:52.070
But before that, water!

14:52.070 --> 14:53.330
As soon as possible!

14:56.200 --> 14:58.210
Where have you been?

14:58.210 --> 14:59.960
Is she your friend, Leviatan?

14:59.960 --> 15:00.870
No.

14:59.960 --> 15:00.870
Yes!

15:02.540 --> 15:04.130
I found you.

15:04.130 --> 15:06.210
You can't run from me.

15:06.210 --> 15:08.800
Don't think I'll go easy on you
just because you're a fairy.

15:09.220 --> 15:11.050
Olstead, you can't just come in and-

15:11.050 --> 15:11.840
Quiet!

15:11.840 --> 15:12.590
Shut your mouth!

15:13.390 --> 15:16.060
Or are you one of her friends, barkeep?

15:17.220 --> 15:19.350
Let me take that cup for you.

15:19.810 --> 15:22.730
Excuse me, could I get a beef bowl?

15:22.730 --> 15:23.400
Okay!

15:23.400 --> 15:24.440
Who are you?

15:24.770 --> 15:26.780
Who cares who we are?

15:26.780 --> 15:29.070
We've got business with
that rude little fairy.

15:29.490 --> 15:31.660
What did you do?

15:29.530 --> 15:32.200
Could I get my usual pudding a la mode?

15:32.070 --> 15:33.530
I spoke my mind.

15:32.200 --> 15:33.410
Okay!

15:33.530 --> 15:35.030
You're still saying that?!

15:35.030 --> 15:36.660
Violence is bad!

15:37.160 --> 15:39.500
Hey! You little...

15:39.500 --> 15:41.500
Here's your beef bowl.

15:41.500 --> 15:44.000
Here's your pudding a la mode.

15:44.460 --> 15:46.710
Damn it, she went that way!

15:48.300 --> 15:50.050
Thanks for the food.

15:48.800 --> 15:50.050
Wait!

15:56.970 --> 15:59.180
Huh? Hey, you!

15:59.180 --> 16:00.980
There you are.

16:00.980 --> 16:03.600
You're the one who started this mess.

16:03.600 --> 16:04.650
It was you.

16:05.150 --> 16:07.320
I'm not finished with you!

16:07.690 --> 16:11.070
How dare you sit around
here and eat pudding?!

16:13.280 --> 16:16.370
If you run around in here,
you're gonna kick up all the dust.

16:16.370 --> 16:18.200
Don't you think you should
learn some table manners...

16:18.200 --> 16:19.870
...instead of hitting on women?

16:20.290 --> 16:23.670
Well, it's not as though you'll be
popular once you learn some manners.

16:23.670 --> 16:27.920
J-Just how much are you
going to insult me?!

16:28.250 --> 16:30.050
You've gone too far!

16:33.720 --> 16:35.760
Listen to me!

16:42.770 --> 16:45.850
This just never ends, does it?

16:49.360 --> 16:50.940
You can't run from us now.

16:51.610 --> 16:52.950
Ouch!

16:54.570 --> 16:55.780
Oh, yeah?

16:55.780 --> 16:57.410
You want to fight, do you?

16:57.660 --> 16:58.910
Run!

16:58.240 --> 16:59.910
Hey, cut it out.

16:58.910 --> 17:00.080
Help!

16:59.910 --> 17:01.370
Calm down, everyone!

17:00.080 --> 17:01.370
It's a fight!

17:06.670 --> 17:08.540
If you're going to fight, fight outside!

17:29.520 --> 17:31.860
I won't miss this time.

17:33.190 --> 17:34.740
My tea...

17:46.710 --> 17:48.750
Finish them!

17:49.840 --> 17:51.920
This is so cool!

17:51.920 --> 17:54.470
Fight! Fight more!

17:54.470 --> 17:57.260
Stop, this is my shop!

17:57.260 --> 17:59.220
You're all so awful!

17:59.890 --> 18:03.770
I've still haven't paid back
my loan on this place!

18:09.860 --> 18:12.270
We destroyed the shop.

18:13.150 --> 18:14.530
What should we do?

18:15.190 --> 18:18.530
What should we say when
we see the barkeep again?

18:19.490 --> 18:22.990
I heard their beef bowls were good,

18:22.990 --> 18:25.290
but I didn't even get to eat a bite...

18:25.290 --> 18:26.410
My pudding...

18:26.410 --> 18:28.500
My pudding a la mode...

18:29.330 --> 18:30.500
Oh, right.

18:30.500 --> 18:32.710
I didn't eat my pasta either.

18:32.710 --> 18:34.800
My extra large serving of pasta!

18:42.850 --> 18:44.810
I haven't introduced myself yet.

18:45.560 --> 18:47.520
I'm Jörmungand.

18:48.350 --> 18:50.150
I'm Bahamut.

18:50.850 --> 18:52.480
I'm Syrop.

18:54.610 --> 18:58.070
I'm Leviatan.

20:12.830 --> 20:20.530
Next Episode

20:15.560 --> 20:20.530
You'll Become Obsessed!
